@ seconds left, seconds since the last draw (0: draw in full) -> countdown of
@ the home view, drawn into PICT: the seconds in the header (3 characters at
@ x=80) and the 2 px bar under it (whole bar, or just erase the slices of the
@ seconds that passed).
\<< \-> l f
  \<<
    IF f NOT THEN
      PICT { #0d #9d } #131d #2d BLANK REPL
      IF l 0 > THEN PICT { #0d #9d } l 131 * 30 / IP R\->B #2d BLANK NEG REPL END
    ELSE
      PICT l 131 * 30 / IP R\->B #9d 2 \->LIST f 131 * 30 / IP 1 + R\->B #2d BLANK REPL
    END
    PICT { #80d #0d } l 10 < " " "" IFTE l \->STR + "s" + 2 \->GROB REPL
  \>>
\>>
